</run>
              <run fontcolor="#41566a" fontsize="10">Coverage = public narratives / all complaints after filters.

Blue: public narrative. Orange: no public narrative.
Hover bars for exact counts; missing text needs a fallback.

Next gate: review labels, fix the evaluation split, compare baselines.

One US month cannot establish Canadian demand, annual trends, model accuracy or operational savings.</run>
